  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Day-to-day-coop, Latvia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Day-to-day-coop, Lettland</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det lettiska Min.of Jus. har tagit initiativ och efterfr&#xe5;gat st&#xf6;d fr&#xe5;nsvenska just. dep. i form av en &quot;Day-to-day-cooperation&quot; (avropsavtal)p&#xe5; omr&#xe5;den som utl&#xe4;mning, r&#xe4;ttshj&#xe4;lp, &#xf6;verf&#xf6;ring av dokument och tredje pelarfr&#xe5;gor. Syftet med insatsen &#xe4;r att den lettiska parten skakunna avropa tj&#xe4;nster p&#xe5; vissa EU-omr&#xe5;den fr&#xe5;n justitiedepartementet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Min. of Just.of Latvia has taken the initiative and asked for support from the Swed. Min.of.Just. in form of a &quot;Day-to-day- cooperation&quot; in areas of extradition, mutual legal assistance, transfer of prisoners and documents and third pillar issues. The aim is that the Latvian part will recieve help from the Swed. Min.of Just.</narrative>
  </description>
